{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a vibrant world filled with challenging levels, formidable bosses, and countless UwUs to collect. Your mission is simple: jump, shoot, fight and navigate through treacherous terrains to gather all the UwUs \u2665 and win the love of your adorable Catgirl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Dynamic Gameplay</strong><br>Experience fast-paced action as you jump and shoot your way through meticulously designed levels. Each level presents unique obstacles and enemies that will test your skills and reflexes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Epic Boss Battles</strong><br>Face off against powerful bosses that will push you to your limits. Learn their patterns, dodge their attacks, and defeat them to progress further in your quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Collect UwUs</strong><br>Unlock and collect UwUs scattered throughout the game. Each UwU you gather brings you one step closer to earning the love of your Catgirl. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094280/extras/hearttogif.gif?t=1741805392\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022\u00a0Earn Your Stars!</strong><br>Race against the clock in every level! Complete levels fast enough to earn a Bronze, Silver, or Gold star, with your best time proudly displayed on the <strong>Steam Leaderboard</strong>. Can you beat your own record and collect all the Gold stars?  <br><strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094280/extras/HighscoreGif.gif?t=1741805392\" /><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Explore the Gallery</strong> <br>Revisit and admire all the UwUs you\u2019ve collected in the Gallery. Relive y